    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2019-boundary-18: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.75";
    dc:description "The majority claim is directly checkable against public pharmacology and literature-linked assay data. Coverage is imperfect, especially for plants, but a systematic analysis can confirm or refute the stated generalization.";
