    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compile commonly used plant and animal anesthetics, quantify evidence that each uncouples gap junctions at anesthetic concentrations, and test whether a majority meet that criterion relative to appropriate non-anesthetic compounds.";
